WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.827 --> 00:00:15.968
ran as fast as he could.

2
00:00:16.588 --> 00:00:18.028
The woman was walking quickly.

3
00:00:18.048 --> 00:00:21.049
"There she goes—behind the restrooms!"

4
00:00:21.349 --> 00:00:21.909
Maggie said.

5
00:00:21.929 --> 00:00:24.390
"We might be able to trap her back there!"

6
00:00:25.390 --> 00:00:27.311
The Lemonade Detectives sped after her.

7
00:00:28.171 --> 00:00:31.732
When they rounded the corner, the woman had stopped to look at some flowers.

8
00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:34.001
"Don't take another step!"

9
00:00:34.201 --> 00:00:34.922
Maggie cried.

10
00:00:35.863 --> 00:00:37.004
The woman looked startled.

11
00:00:37.744 --> 00:00:38.805
She backed away from them.

12
00:00:38.825 --> 00:00:40.687
"Who are you?"

13
00:00:41.707 --> 00:00:42.768
Henry stepped forward.

14
00:00:43.489 --> 00:00:45.991
"We were about to ask you the same thing."

15
00:00:47.072 --> 00:00:48.132
His heart was pounding.

16
00:00:48.773 --> 00:00:50.534
They had to get the woman to confess!

17
00:00:50.554 --> 00:00:53.577
"Very funny," the woman snapped.

18
00:00:54.337 --> 00:00:56.299
"Now what do you want?"

19
00:00:56.319 --> 00:01:00.602
"We want you to give back our friend's painting," Cole said.

20
00:01:01.523 --> 00:01:02.364
The woman blinked.

21
00:01:03.100 --> 00:01:06.602
"What?" "Nathan's painting," Henry said.

22
00:01:06.622 --> 00:01:08.303
"We know you took it.

23
00:01:08.843 --> 00:01:10.304
Now tell us why you did it."

24
00:01:11.265 --> 00:01:13.186
The woman shook her head, looking puzzled.

25
00:01:13.206 --> 00:01:16.668
"I didn't take anybody's painting."

26
00:01:16.688 --> 00:01:19.450
"Then why did you run away from us earlier?"

27
00:01:19.650 --> 00:01:20.450
Maggie demanded.

28
00:01:21.331 --> 00:01:22.431
The woman peered at her.

29
00:01:23.732 --> 00:01:24.733
"Oh, was that you?

30
00:01:24.753 --> 00:01:27.414
I didn't get a good look at you then."

31
00:01:28.595 --> 00:01:29.235
She frowned.

32
00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:35.767
"Wait! Were you kids chasing me earlier because you thought I stole some painting?"

33
00:01:35.787 --> 00:01:38.308
"That's right," Henry said.

34
00:01:39.229 --> 00:01:40.930
The woman touched her bright red hair.

35
00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:45.072
"So you weren't following me because you recognized me?"

36
00:01:45.092 --> 00:01:47.073
"Yes, we were!"

37
00:01:47.733 --> 00:01:49.374
Maggie crossed her arms over her chest.

38
00:01:49.394 --> 00:01:52.796
"We recognized you as an international art thief!"

39
00:01:54.017 --> 00:01:56.558
"Wait." Henry was listening carefully.

40
00:01:56.578 --> 00:01:59.380
"Why else would we recognize you?

41
00:02:00.524 --> 00:02:03.165
We already guessed you were from out of town, remember?"

42
00:02:04.306 --> 00:02:06.487
This time the woman turned to peer at Henry.

43
00:02:06.507 --> 00:02:07.807
"You did?"

44
00:02:08.507 --> 00:02:09.628
Suddenly she nodded.

45
00:02:09.648 --> 00:02:11.669
"Oh right.

46
00:02:12.249 --> 00:02:14.390
You're the kids from the lemonade stand!"

47
00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:16.811
"Yes," Cole said.

48
00:02:16.831 --> 00:02:18.031
"Who are you?"

49
00:02:18.051 --> 00:02:21.793
"Daniella Diaz, of course!"

50
00:02:23.594 --> 00:02:25.935
The woman paused, looking at each of the kids.

51
00:02:27.135 --> 00:02:29.236
"The world-famous artist?"

52
00:02:30.440 --> 00:02:32.061
Henry and the others looked at each other.

53
00:02:33.182 --> 00:02:34.022
Cole shrugged.

54
00:02:34.042 --> 00:02:35.983
"Sorry," he said.

55
00:02:36.003 --> 00:02:38.404
"I guess we don't know much about art."

56
00:02:39.425 --> 00:02:41.546
"Clearly." Daniella frowned.

57
00:02:41.566 --> 00:02:43.887
"Well, that's all right.

58
00:02:44.708 --> 00:02:47.109
I didn't want to be recognized today anyway.

59
00:02:48.910 --> 00:02:52.872
That's why I was trying to get out of sight when I saw the judges heading my way.

60
00:02:53.953 --> 00:02:56.394
I knew they'd spot me even in this wig."

61
00:02:57.154 --> 00:02:58.295
She patted her hair again.

62
00:02:58.315 --> 00:03:00.176
"That's a wig?"

63
00:03:00.488 --> 00:03:01.408
Maggie stared at it.

64
00:03:01.428 --> 00:03:09.092
"Wow." "So if you're really a world-famous artist, what are you doing in Belltown?"

65
00:03:09.372 --> 00:03:10.152
Cole asked.

66
00:03:11.253 --> 00:03:12.593
"Yeah," Henry added.

67
00:03:12.613 --> 00:03:18.456
"And if you're a famous artist who doesn't want to be recognized, what are you doing at an

68
00:03:18.556 --> 00:03:19.076
art show?"

69
00:03:20.336 --> 00:03:23.418
"I'm visiting relatives in the area," Daniella replied.

70
00:03:23.438 --> 00:03:27.339
"I didn't know this art show was going on until I got here."

71
00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:28.720
She shrugged.

72
00:03:29.644 --> 00:03:33.186
"But once I heard about it, I couldn't resist coming to take a look.

73
00:03:34.227 --> 00:03:36.748
I wanted to check for small-town talent."

74
00:03:38.209 --> 00:03:42.891
"So you really didn't have anything to do with our friend's painting disappearing?"

75
00:03:43.152 --> 00:03:43.892
Henry asked.

76
00:03:43.912 --> 00:03:46.133
"Of course not."

77
00:03:46.754 --> 00:03:48.134
Daniella looked insulted.

78
00:03:48.154 --> 00:03:51.436
"I create art—I don't steal it."

79
00:03:52.397 --> 00:03:53.157
Henry nodded.

80
00:03:53.177 --> 00:03:56.659
"Okay. Sorry we suspected you."

81
00:03:56.679 --> 00:04:02.911
"Yeah. And sorry we don't know who you are, even though you're famous," Cole added.

82
00:04:03.832 --> 00:04:04.912
Daniella frowned.

83
00:04:04.932 --> 00:04:09.075
"Yes, well, I suppose that's for the best," she said.

84
00:04:09.095 --> 00:04:12.758
"You kids won't give away my secret, will you?"

85
00:04:12.778 --> 00:04:15.740
"Of course not," Cole promised.

86
00:04:16.961 --> 00:04:18.722
Maggie pulled a coin out of her pocket.

87
00:04:18.742 --> 00:04:21.544
"Here's your quarter back," she added.

88
00:04:21.564 --> 00:04:23.945
"You never got the lemonade you paid for."

89
00:04:24.926 --> 00:04:26.167
Daniella looked surprised.

90
00:04:26.187 --> 00:04:29.136
"Thanks." She took the coin.

91
00:04:29.156 --> 00:04:31.177
"Now I'd better go.

92
00:04:32.257 --> 00:04:34.978
I don't want to miss the judging, and it's about to start."

93
00:04:38.879 --> 00:04:41.420
As she hurried off, Henry glanced at the town clock.

94
00:04:42.460 --> 00:04:44.961
"She's right," he said with a sigh.

95
00:04:44.981 --> 00:04:46.662
"It's two o'clock."

96
00:04:47.782 --> 00:04:51.523
"We'd better find Nathan and give him the bad news," Cole said.

97
00:04:51.543 --> 00:04:54.644
"Yeah," Maggie looked hopeful.

98
00:04:55.800 --> 00:05:01.202
"Maybe he found his painting while we were running around chasing Nora and a world-famous artist we never

99
00:05:01.262 --> 00:05:01.782
heard of."

100
00:05:06.363 --> 00:05:08.804
But when they found Nathan, he looked sad.

101
00:05:09.864 --> 00:05:12.485
He was staring at the empty spot where his painting had hung.

102
00:05:12.505 --> 00:05:19.287
"Oh well," he said when The Lemonade Detectives told him what had happened.

103
00:05:19.307 --> 00:05:22.328
"I guess I can try again next year.

104
00:05:23.368 --> 00:05:26.089
My painting probably wouldn't have won a prize anyway."

105
00:05:27.190 --> 00:05:28.370
Henry felt terrible.

106
00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:32.352
This was the first case that The Lemonade Detectives had failed to solve.

107
00:05:34.393 --> 00:05:37.534
They all wandered over to the judges, to watch them make their rounds.

108
00:05:38.595 --> 00:05:40.675
The judges were examining Patrick's painting.

109
00:05:40.695 --> 00:05:44.777
"Lovely use of light and shade," the art teacher was saying.

110
00:05:44.797 --> 00:05:47.738
"Indeed," the curator agreed.

111
00:05:47.758 --> 00:05:50.960
"Quite accomplished for such a young artist."

112
00:05:52.232 --> 00:05:55.035
Henry looked around to see what Patrick thought of their comments.

113
00:05:56.056 --> 00:05:58.399
To his surprise, Patrick was nowhere in sight.

114
00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:01.943
However, he did notice Hannah watching nearby.

115
00:06:02.944 --> 00:06:06.007
Henry stared from Hannah to Patrick's painting and back again.

116
00:06:06.027 --> 00:06:11.053
"I just remembered something that doesn't quite make sense," he told his friends.

117
00:06:11.073 --> 00:06:13.716
"Hurry—let's go check it out!"
